# Published to the public repository as .gitignore.
#
# This repository is written by _dev/export_public.R in the workshop repository,
# so the only things that appear here uninvited are build outputs and whatever a
# reader's own R session leaves behind.

# ---- R / RStudio ----
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
.env
*.Rproj.user

# ---- Quarto build outputs (regenerated by `quarto render`) ----
/_site/
/.quarto/
/cache/
*_cache/
**/*_files/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# ---- Data ----
# Raw inputs are never committed. Each post's R/01_get_data.R re-creates them
# (download from source or from the post's GitHub Release).
**/data-raw/

# ---- Deployment leftovers ----
_publish.yml

# ---- Editor / OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
